                <pb facs="1288" n="1278" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg1278"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.42700 SE/6–2047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-30T19:00:00-04:00">June 30, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>808. Dept gratified learn Ministry’s approval substance draft Fulbright agreement
                    (Embtel 1350 June 20). Dept concurs suggested changes Article 5 and insertion
                    paragraph re Chinese advisors. Dept agrees in principle Emb substitution Article
                    11 and recommendation <hi rendition="#italic">pro forma</hi> concessions be
                    granted incl name of foundation. Inc these changes new draft which will be
                    discussed with Chinese here. Will keep Emb advised.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
